  },
  "historyFundingLimits": [
    "Only actual retained loan/reservation/persistence/finality lineage, intervening swaps and other material observed use, exclusive ownership and fresh sync are required.",
    "Do not demand exhaustive absence of hypothetical external use or lifetime accounting for unrelated accounts.",
    "Known material pending ambiguity remains a blocker; historical unknown costs never become zero or old credit.",
    "grossByLogicalAsset is a gross ceiling, not initial funding need. Fixed initialize mints20000000000 test units. Native color/domain must be authenticated, not an arbitrary logical label.",
    "DUST SPECK available/generated quantities and reserved caps remain distinct from paid indexer fees; no invented conversion."
  ],
